⚡🇬🇧🇮🇷 two Iranian citizens have been charged with an alleged terrorist plot against the Jewish community in Manchester on the eve of Yom Kippur. 

They are a 36-year-old from Liverpool and a 34-year-old from Salford, arrested on September 20. According to the police, the two had maintained contact with a third individual abroad, possibly in Iran, in relation to the plot.

